OL,3,GNEWSAWedding dash for Emmy-nominated
OL,4,Acasting director
OL,5,
OL,6,FA casting director from Kidderminster
OL,7,Fis facing a race against the clock to
OL,8,Fget from his sister's wedding in
OL,9,FWorcester, to the Emmy awards in Los
OL,10,FAngeles.
OL,12,FMatt Lander, who left his hometown aged
OL,13,F18 to pursue a career in the US, has
OL,14,Fbeen nominated for an Emmy for the
OL,15,Fcasting of the drama miniseries, All
OL,16,FHer Fault.
OL,18,FBefore he heads back to the US, Lander
OL,19,Fwill be helping his sister, Emma,
OL,20,Fcelebrate her wedding on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
