OL,3,GNEWSAWedding dash for Emmy-nominated
OL,4,Acasting director
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe plans to leave the celebrations
OL,7,Fearly on Sunday morning, taking a 04:00
OL,8,FBST car to London before catching an
OL,9,F08:00 flight from Heathrow to LA. If
OL,10,Fall goes to plan he will arrive about
OL,11,Ftwo hours before the awards begin.
